Eliminating False PositivesWithout this validation loop, a list like a) System initialization, b) Core ledger sync might trick a weak layout engine into flagging it as an inline equation due to the isolated characters and punctuation. The validation layer cross-references the flagged region to ensure it contains at least one explicit mathematical relation or operator while maintaining valid balancing properties before approving the coordinates.By locking down the coordinate zones via this four-layer confirmation model, you can safely hand off the exact pixel or character coordinates of the math block to your downstream extraction systems without risking the structure of your main prose documents.
